    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41799" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπομβρ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pour rain upon</i> :—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				11.365.7
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>pour like rain upon,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.48
				</span></i>
