				296
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>gush out over, abound as rain,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ -οῦντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.441
				</span></i>
			.</div>
